{\sect \sectd }\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 2\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Paragraphs 1 to 3 of the Protocol to the Agreement between the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region of the People\u8217??s Republic of China and the Government of the Kingdom of Thailand for the Avoidance of Double Taxation and the Prevention of Fiscal Evasion with respect to Taxes on Income\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi0\li0\tx720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 The Agreement applies to the existing taxes set out in sub-paragraph (a) of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 paragraph 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0  of Article 2, whether or not charged under personal assessment.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi0\li0\tx720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 In the Agreement, the terms \u8220??Hong Kong Special Administrative Region tax\u8221?? and \u8220??Thai tax\u8221?? do not include any penalty or interest imposed under the laws of either Contracting Party relating to the taxes to which this Agreement applies by virtue of Article 2. In the case of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, \u8220??penalty or interest\u8221?? includes, without limitation, any sum added to Hong Kong Special Administrative Region tax by reason of default and recovered therewith, and \u8220??additional tax\u8221?? assessed for infringement of or failure to comply with its tax laws.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi0\li0\tx720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of Article 8, income and profits from the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic shall include in particular:}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li720\tqr\tx480\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 revenues and gross receipts from the operation of ships or aircraft for the transport of persons, livestock, goods, mail or merchandise in international traffic including,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1380\tqr\tx1140\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1380\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1380\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1380\cf1 \f0 income derived from the lease of ships or aircraft on a bareboat charter basis where such lease is incidental to the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1380\tqr\tx1140\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1380\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1380\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1380\cf1 \f0 income derived from the sale of tickets and the provision of services connected with such transport whether for the enterprise itself or for any other enterprise, provided that in the case of provision of services, such provision is incidental to the operation of ships and aircraft in international traffic;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li720\tqr\tx480\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 interest on funds directly connected with the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic and deposited in savings accounts;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li720\tqr\tx480\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 profits from the lease of containers by the enterprise, when such lease is incidental to the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic.\par }}
